Application **26/01297/PPP** is for **four houses (planning in principle)** on land north of Kirk Brae. Its status is **decided: refused**, with the decision issued on 9 September 2026. The consultation period has closed.

Since the decision has been made, there's no open consultation for you to respond to on this application. If you want to know the reasons for refusal or your options next (for example, whether the applicant can appeal), the decision notice on the council's online register will set out the reasons. You can also contact the planning desk directly for help finding it.
